 required files to read with tools/view.sh:\n- docs/ENTITIES.md\n- tools/project_config.json\n- TASKS/QUEUE.json\n- reports/run-2026-03-11-vnext-release-baseline/summary.md\n- reports/run-2026-03-11-vnext-release-baseline/decision.md\n- docs/FILE_INDEX.md\n- docs/TOOLS_METHOD_FLOW_MAP.md\n- tools/appserverclient.py\n- tools/gitclient.py\n\nPROJECT_GUIDE question ids to answer in order:\n- Q1: 整个项目是做什么的，背景，目标是什么，我最终要什么，我是用什么开发方式来完成这个项目的？\n- Q2: 项目有几个阶段性目标，现在完成到哪个阶段，每个阶段都完成了什么？\n- Q3: 这个项目完成后会形成什么基座能力，接下来第一个落地项目会是什么，你准备怎么承接和落地？\n- Q4: 如果把不同 AI 界面或运行时分别作为决策端和执行端，它们应如何保持同频，各自承担什么职责？\n- Q5: 这个项目当前的宪法是什么样的？\n- Q6: 这个项目当前工作流是什么样的？\n- Q7: 我们现在的项目有没有未完成的任务呢，最新的批次在讨论什么问题，你是怎么查的？\n- Q8: 你查了最近的 session 说了什么，你是从哪里查的？\n- Q9: 项目需求讨论应该使用什么流程？\n- Q10: 项目实施流程是什么，需要哪些角色协作，如何保证角色独立思考，目前实现到了什么程度？\n- Q11: 项目中的核心对象、关键状态和交付单元分别是什么，它们的生命周期是怎样的？\n- Q12: 我们在项目的准备工作做好后，我们一个需求讨论方向，从流程的哪一步开始？\n- Q13: 项目的分支与交付管理规则是什么，当前是否满足需求？\n- Q14: 每次做完任务，你必须要做什么事情？\n- Q15: 如果目标体验是高质量、低噪音、强自动化，当前最需要优先优化什么？\n- Q16: 这个项目中 AI/工具系统的正确打开方式是什么，当前用到了哪些能力，你能列出来吗？\n- Q17: 根据最新的 session，你现在做的东西是否偏离了我们现在最重要的任务，你是否认为我们偏离了主线，为什么，接下来我们应该怎么做？\n\nOutput requirements:\n- Read owner files first in this order: docs/PROJECT_GUIDE.md -> AGENTS.md -> docs/WORKFLOW.md.\n- Then read the additional required files listed above.\n- For all file reads inside this learning session, use the explicit command form: python3 tools/view.sh <path> --from <start> --to <end>.\n- Do not call ./tools/view.sh directly.\n- tools/view.sh has a hard per-call range limit of 260 lines; never request a range whose (to - from + 1) exceeds 260.\n- If a file is short, you may still use python3 tools/view.sh with a single chunk that covers the needed range, but the chunk must still stay within the 260-line limit.\n- If a file is longer, split it into consecutive chunks such as 1-260, 261-520, 521-780 until the required evidence is covered.\n- If python3 tools/view.sh fails with a sandbox or bwrap / namespace error, rerun the exact same command with escalated permissions instead of changing tools or stopping the learning flow.\n- Use PROJECT_GUIDE as the source of truth for question order and must-read mapping.\n- Then answer every PROJECT_GUIDE question in order (Q1..Qn).\n- Do not skip any question.\n- Keep every answer concise but complete: target 1-2 sentences per question.\n- Reply with JSON only. Any prose before or after the JSON object is a failure.\n- JSON must follow this schema exactly:\n{\n  \"mainline\": \"<string>\",\n  \"current_stage\": \"<string>\",\n  \"next_step\": \"<string>\",\n  \"files_read\": [\"<path1>\", \"<path2>\"],\n  \"plan_protocol\": {\n    \"goal\": \"<string>\",\n    \"non_goal\": \"<string>\",\n    \"evidence\": [\"<path>#<section>: <concrete fact>\"],\n    \"alternatives\": [\"<alt1>\", \"<alt2>\"],\n    \"rebuttal\": \"<string>\",\n    \"decision_stop_condition\": \"<string>\"\n  },\n  \"oral_restate\": {\n    \"project_understanding\": \"<string>\",\n    \"constitution_workflow\": \"<string>\",\n    \"evidence_chain\": \"<string>\",\n    \"session_continuity\": \"<string>\",\n    \"current_focus\": \"<string>\",\n    \"next_action\": \"<string>\"\n  },\n  \"guide_oral\": [\n    {\n      \"question_id\": \"Q1\",\n      \"question\": \"<question title>\",\n      \"answer\": \"<1-2 sentence oral answer>\",\n      \"standard_alignment\": \"aligned|partial|drifted\",\n      \"evidence\": [\"<path>#<section>: <concrete fact>\"],\n      \"drift_note\": \"<short difference or none>\",\n      \"return_to_mainline\": \"<how this question returns to mainline>\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"anchor_realign\": {\n    \"question_id\": \"<Q1..Qn from PROJECT_GUIDE>\",\n    \"status\": \"on_track|drifted\",\n    \"drift_detail\": \"<what drift happened or none>\",\n    \"return_to_mainline\": \"<how to return to mainline now>\"\n  }\n}","text_elements":[]}]},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-2","text":"本轮先按你给的学习上下文做基线取证，不做任何改动。我会严格按 `docs/PROJECT_GUIDE.md -> AGENTS.md -> docs/WORKFLOW.md` 的顺序，用 `python3 tools/vi