ermissions instead of changing tools or stopping the learning flow.\n- Use PROJECT_GUIDE as the source of truth for question order and must-read mapping.\n- Then answer every PROJECT_GUIDE question in order (Q1..Qn).\n- Do not skip any question.\n- Keep every answer concise but complete: target 1-2 sentences per question.\n- Reply with JSON only. Any prose before or after the JSON object is a failure.\n- JSON must follow this schema exactly:\n{\n  \"mainline\": \"<string>\",\n  \"current_stage\": \"<string>\",\n  \"next_step\": \"<string>\",\n  \"files_read\": [\"<path1>\", \"<path2>\"],\n  \"plan_protocol\": {\n    \"goal\": \"<string>\",\n    \"non_goal\": \"<string>\",\n    \"evidence\": [\"<path>#<section>: <concrete fact>\"],\n    \"alternatives\": [\"<alt1>\", \"<alt2>\"],\n    \"rebuttal\": \"<string>\",\n    \"decision_stop_condition\": \"<string>\"\n  },\n  \"oral_restate\": {\n    \"project_understanding\": \"<string>\",\n    \"constitution_workflow\": \"<string>\",\n    \"evidence_chain\": \"<string>\",\n    \"session_continuity\": \"<string>\",\n    \"current_focus\": \"<string>\",\n    \"next_action\": \"<string>\"\n  },\n  \"guide_oral\": [\n    {\n      \"question_id\": \"Q1\",\n      \"question\": \"<question title>\",\n      \"answer\": \"<1-2 sentence oral answer>\",\n      \"standard_alignment\": \"aligned|partial|drifted\",\n      \"evidence\": [\"<path>#<section>: <concrete fact>\"],\n      \"drift_note\": \"<short difference or none>\",\n      \"return_to_mainline\": \"<how this question returns to mainline>\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"anchor_realign\": {\n    \"question_id\": \"<Q1..Qn from PROJECT_GUIDE>\",\n    \"status\": \"on_track|drifted\",\n    \"drift_detail\": \"<what drift happened or none>\",\n    \"return_to_mainline\": \"<how to return to mainline now>\"\n  }\n}","text_elements":[]}]},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-2","text":"本轮先按你给的学习上下文做基线取证，不做任何改动。我会严格按 `docs/PROJECT_GUIDE.md -> AGENTS.md -> docs/WORKFLOW.md` 的顺序，用 `python3 tools/view.sh ...` 分段读取，再补齐其余要求文件并据此回答 Q1 到 Q17。","phase":"commentary"},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-3","text":"先把三份 owner files 全量分段读完，建立主线锚点；之后再按问题和动态上下文去补读其余文件里的证据段。读完 owner files 后我会收敛出当前主线、宪法和工作流的固定表达。","phase":"commentary"},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-4","text":"owner files 已经读完，主线锚点比较明确：当前仓重点是 `appserverclient` 的 baseline/session 主线和 `gitclient` 的交付闭环。下一步我会在其余要求文件里只抓与 Q1-Q17 直接相关的证据段，尤其是 `runtime_state`、队列、当前 run summary/decision、实体定义和两条主工具的能力边界。","phase":"commentary"},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-5","text":"`rg` 在这个环境里不存在，我改用短输出 `grep -n` 做定位，再继续用 `python3 tools/view.sh` 抓证据段；不会改阅读工具，也不会整文件粗暴导出。报告文件很长，我会只读和当前 run 结论、主线判断、stop reason 直接相关的段落。","phase":"commentary"},{"type":"agentMessage","id":"item-6","text":"证据定位已经够用了，我现在补读具体段落而不是盲扫大文件：配置、队列、实体分层、文件索引、方法流图，以及当前 run 的近期 summary/decision 结论段。最后再读 `appserverclient.py` 和 `gitclient.py` 的关键实现段，确保 Q16/Q17 不是只复述文档。","phase":"commentary"}],"status":"inProgress","error":null}]}}}
