2026-03-18T15:01:12.833854+00:00 {"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"agentMessage","id":"msg_0e9f5205821014880169babdc6dc508191b028a4586e518021","text":"{\n  \"mainline\": \"当前正式主线已收敛为三层：`init` 做准备，`appserverclient` 负责 baseline/run/session/role runtime，`gitclient` 负责提交/PR/回滚；日常围绕 `learnbaseline -> 明确 run 方向 -> fork-current -> 按需 role threads -> summarize-current -> refresh-baseline -> commit` 推进。\",\n  \"current_stage\": \"项目仍处于 foundation 自身硬化阶段，重点是把 baseline/session/git 三条底层能力收稳，并在外部项目嵌入验证中继续去噪主线与文档口径。\",\n  \"next_step\": \"围绕当前 active task `task-session-denoise-and-mainline-cleanup`，继续把 foundation 嵌入外部项目的状态、run evidence 表达和 owner docs 主线做最小收口，避免旧流程噪音重新污染 baseline 与 run summary。\",\n  \"files_read\": [\n    \"docs/PROJECT_GUIDE.md\",\n    \"AGENTS.md\",\n    \"docs/WORKFLOW.md\",\n    \"docs/ENTITIES.md\",\n    \"tools/project_config.json\",\n    \"TASKS/QUEUE.json\",\n    \"reports/run-2026-03-11-vnext-release-baseline/summary.md\",\n    \"reports/run-2026-03-11-vnext-release-baseline/decision.md\",\n    \"docs/FILE_INDEX.md\",\n    \"docs/TOOLS_METHOD_FLOW_MAP.md\",\n    \"tools/appserverclient.py\",\n    \"tools/gitclient.py\"\n  ],\n  \"plan_protocol\": {\n    \"goal\": \"用 `PROJECT_GUIDE` 的 17 问把项目目标、宪法、工作流、对象分层、当前 run/task 和最近 session 连成一条证据主线，确保后续执行不靠聊天记忆。\",\n    \"non_goal\": \"不在这轮学习里做代码改动、不扩旧流程、不把业务项目细节写回 foundation 主线。\",\n    \"evidence\": [\n      \"docs/PROJECT_GUIDE.md#一句话北极星: 北极星是“自动化 -> 自我迭代 -> 涌现智能”，且 learn 必须先读题库再按必查文件补证据。\",\n      \"AGENTS.md#4. Mandatory session gate: 正式主线固定为 `learnbaseline -> run direction -> fork -> summarize-current -> refresh-baseline -> gitclient`。\",\n      \"docs/WORKFLOW.md#4.6 Shortest Stable Mainline: 当前推荐最短稳定主线只保留必要动作，不为更纯继续拆中间层。\",\n      \"tools/project_config.json#runtime_state: 当前 run 是 `run-2026-03-11-vnext-release-baseline`，当前 task 是 `task-session-denoise-and-mainline-cleanup`。\",\n      \"TASKS/QUEUE.json#items[0]: 当前唯一 active queue item 的目标是总结 foundation 嵌入外部项目状态、清理 queue 噪音并收口主线文档。\",\n 